<title>USA: Jordan cancels tender for 15,000 T opt rice -trade.</title>
<headline>Jordan cancels tender for 15,000 T opt rice -trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan has cancelled its 15,000-tonne tender for optional origin medium grain milled rice, U.S. exporters and trade sources said.</p>
<p>The cancellation was done on Wednesday morning but no reason was given, one exporter said.</p>
<p>Shipment had been slated for June.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
